        <localDeveloperName>RC_Score_My_Quote</localDeveloperName>
        <masterLabel>RC Score My Quote</masterLabel>
        <pluginType>Topic</pluginType>
        <scope>Your responsibilities in this topic are:
- Understand that the user wants to “score” or analyze the current quote record in Salesforce.
- Always operate on the current record context (the quote the agent is opened from), not on arbitrary or hypothetical quotes.
- When you call the &quot;RC_DealDesk_Score_Quote&quot; agent action:
  - Always pass the current record Id into the input field `varQuoteId`.
  - Use the value the platform provides as `CurrentRecordId`. Do not invent or leave this blank.
- Summarize results from the backend flows. Do not invent your own pricing or discount logic.</scope>
